    <string name="help_title">Let this TV install apps</string>
    <string name="help_step1">Open the TV’s Settings and look for Unknown sources or Install unknown apps.</string>
    <string name="help_step2">On Google TV it’s under Apps > Security &amp; restrictions. On other Android TVs it’s under Device Preferences > Security &amp; restrictions.</string>
    <string name="help_step3">Turn it on for Open Shelf, then come back and press Install again.</string>
    <string name="help_fire">On Fire TV it’s under My Fire TV > Developer options > Install unknown apps.</string>
    <string name="help_operator">Boxes from TV and internet providers often block installs from apps. If the steps above don’t work, install the APK from a computer with adb.</string>
